WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.350
<b>Ten Years Ago</b>

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.690
I see that wound still hasn't healed, Souya.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.860
I consider it a badge of honor.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:22.790
<b>Mejiro Station</b>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:18.850
I'm going.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.890
Please be careful.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.590
Why...

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.630
Why is it only you...?

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.770
This is a Buranki's heart?

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:51.980
It's so beautiful.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.150
Leticia-sama,

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:56.560
now you can awaken Epimeu,

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:01.080
the Buranki in our homeland of England,
from its long sleep.

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.650
Remaining on this island any longer 
will endanger your health.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:10.480
We've fulfilled our goal.

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.000
Let's return to the manor.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.880
Thank you, Moses.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.640
Looks like the teams from those 
other countries are here, too.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:28.010
This is getting so exciting, 
it's almost like a festival!

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:31.770
And now it's time for a nice,
fun Buranki hunt!

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:32.980
Enough of your crap!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:37.570
Do you want to wreck Treasure Island, 
the birthplace of all Bubuki?!

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.160
Be quiet, brat.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.240
Long time no see, Souya-kun.

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:56.760
You look well.

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:01.950
No, it's you who looks as 
lovely as ever, Migiwa-san.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:04.720
Thanks so much for all you've done.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.980
Man, you're definitely amazing!
I'm impressed!

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:13.600
Not only did you abandon everything 
and come here to keep the Buranki

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.980
that kept threatening humanity 
from falling to Earth,

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:19.980
but you continued to keep them from

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:24.990
falling even after losing 
your husband and kids.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:29.460
But just tell me one thing.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:33.790
Why did you stop the hearts 
of all the Buranki on Earth?

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.870
Stopped their hearts?

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:37.800
Sixteen years ago,

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.100
the day you went up to Treasure Island,

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.940
you sent a signal from here that stopped

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:49.310
the hearts of all Buranki on Earth. Why?

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:53.690
So that's why the heart 
Epizo-san had wasn't beating.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:59.110
The world fell into chaos without the 
Buranki to act as a deterrent force.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:04.660
Yet, for some reason,
only Entei's heart didn't stop.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.870
As a result, Reoko-sama became the

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:11.420
only one in the world who 
could operate a Buranki.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:17.340
And all the hatred of the world 
was directed toward her and Entei.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.760
Even though she hunted down

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.640
and killed every last headless 
Buranki that came from here!

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:27.090
For ten years now, Reoko-sama is 
the one who's been called a witch,

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.700
and not you!

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.810
Why don't you say something?

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.310
I'm sorry.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.690
Huh?

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:42.320
Souya-kun, it seems I've caused 
much pain for you and Reoko.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:44.200
I really am sorry.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:49.700
You're "sorry"? Is that your idea of a joke?

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:02.850
Too easy!

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:05.050
That's...

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.530
The rock girl!

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:07.680
Forget her.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.530
Is that the Russian team 
Shizuru was talking about?

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:14.560
Why are they here?

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.070
I don't care who they are.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.820
I won't let them harm 
Treasure Island any further!

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.390
Hiiragi-kun!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.370
Hiiragi-kun, please, help me.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.870
All right.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:31.160
If this keeps up, Treasure Island will fall.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:35.090
If that happens,
many living things will die.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:39.110
There will be more death 
than mankind has ever seen.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.090
I must stop them, whatever it takes.

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:51.930
<i>The island's already taken enough 
damage to fall into the ocean.</i>

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.940
<i>What are those Russians planning?</i>

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:56.560
Arabashiri!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.980
What are you looking at?!

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.240
Don't make me say it again!

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.600
Stay out of this, brat!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.610
Do it, Kogane!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.160
Got it, Kinoa-chan!

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:10.530
Damn!

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:21.070
We kids have our own way 
of fighting, Arabashiri!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:29.310
Elder Brother, we detonated 
all the remaining explosives.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:35.160
Is this not going a bit far,
just to obtain a Buranki's heart?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.730
I will drop this island onto my motherland.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.410
Huh?

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:43.320
W-Were those Monsieur Guy's orders?

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:46.490
Hey, Lyu...

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:51.380
Do you not think it's time 
to cull the mice that only

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.910
taint our air and eat our food?

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:57.330
Yes...

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:03.090
But, Elder Brother, what will 
happen to Mother and Father then?

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:06.660
Keen minds, beautiful looks,

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.800
an excellent bloodline,
status that makes all subservient to us,

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.250
and our Bubuki...

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:17.310
Have we not already inherited everything 
there is to inherit from our parents?

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:22.730
The time has come to bring about our 
motherland's rebirth by our own hands!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.070
I will lead an army of Buranki

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.900
and surpass even Guy!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.580
That's our elder brother!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.100
A plan as far-reaching as the Arctic Ocean!

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.490
You could see a hundred years ahead—

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:43.230
Where do you think you're aiming, fool?!

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.920
I don't know who you are,

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:59.670
but I won't let you do as you please 
on Treasure Island any longer!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.770
Thank you, Hiiragi-kun.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.400
Thank you, Iwatooshi.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.500
You know Iwatooshi?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.730
Yoshiki-san, your father,

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.830
was Iwatooshi's user.

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:27.480
In the past, your father 
helped me many times.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:33.590
Then why did you abandon him and come here?!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:38.130
You know a bunch of Buranki attacked 
before we were born, right?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.640
Isn't that why you came here?

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:45.980
Then you should've brought 
my dad along to help you!

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:49.400
If you'd done that, he... he...

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.020
He wouldn't have ended up like that.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:56.750
You were born the day before I came here.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.310
Unlike in my case,

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:04.920
Iwatooshi chose you as its next master,

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.240
causing Yoshiki-san to lose his powers.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:13.550
So it felt wrong to drag someone 
into the battle who couldn't fight.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.500
What do you mean, "drag" him into it?

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:18.930
There's nothing wrong with
relying on your teammates!

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:22.780
I know my dad wanted you 
to rely on him, too!

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.950
He wanted you to say you'd 
all come here together!

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:26.900
I know it!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:32.950
I'm sorry... I lost my temper.

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.530
No, it's all right.

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:40.120
I was never very good at verbally 
expressing my feelings to people.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:44.120
So I envy you for that.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.340
I'm going inside Treasure 
Island through here.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.680
Come with me, Hiiragi-kun.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.250
Right!

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:04.360
Little girls...

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:08.020
You'll have to grow up into
women if you want to defeat me.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:13.900
Kogane... Don't get up!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.530
Sheesh, talk about persistent.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:23.490
I've got nothing against you,
but if you keep getting in my way,

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.370
I'll have to make you go to sleep for a bit.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.210
D-Don't!

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.080
The end.

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:42.060
Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch...

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:46.030
What the hell are you trying to pull?

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:48.190
Huh, Matobai-san?

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.020
Well, now...

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.990
That's a good question,

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.930
Souya.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.950
<b>Episode 11
The Immortal Girl</b>

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.300
What are you doing?!

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:10.910
It was just a bit of a whim, that's all.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:12.590
Quit messing around!

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:17.930
I'd rather die than have you help me!

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:21.390
I'm sure.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:25.180
See? That's what you get for doing 
something out of character!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.520
My thoughts exactly!

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.930
What are you trying to do, Senpai?

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.830
In fact, why are you even here?!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:55.880
I should ask what you're doing 
sneaking around behind our backs.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.770
Our objective was to capture 
the traitor Migiwa

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.720
and deliver her to Reoko-sama, was it not?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.330
So what do you think you're doing,

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:08.060
working with those guys 
from Russia and America?

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.900
Is that scar you got protecting 
Reoko-sama just for show?! Huh?!

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:17.400
What the hell do you know?

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:29.130
Reoko-sama...

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:33.750
Is that you, Little Sou?

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:36.860
The headless Buranki...

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:38.840
How many headless Buranki are left?!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.860
Answer me, Souya!

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:43.660
Answer me!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.290
Reoko-sama!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.270
Souya, tell me!

00:11:51.760 --> 00:11:54.140
There are six left.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:57.000
The two that fell in Shinjuku and Oshiage

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.770
have already awakened and begun to move.

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:07.230
Please, wait, Reoko-sama!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:11.870
You lost your life twice in the last 
two battles against headless Buranki!

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.880
At Haneda, your body was crushed,

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:18.130
and here in Mejiro, you were burned alive.

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:23.210
And yet, your body defied the laws of nature

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:24.920
and came back to life twice.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.860
And what is your point?

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.770
So long as Entei is with me,

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.010
I can come back to life
an infinite number of times.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.900
There's no reason for you to worry.

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:40.350
Reoko-sama, I realize your body

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:44.320
can recover at a remarkable speed, 
no matter how badly you're hurt,

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.870
but your brain... Only your brain...

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:49.490
Only my brain, what?

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:53.690
It takes damage every 
time your body revives.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.500
Clouded memories, mental regression...

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:00.550
They prove that it's true! 
If you keep this up...

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:06.390
I'll eventually turn into a lump of 
flesh with no understanding of who I am?

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:10.260
Now we have a secret.

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:14.110
Make no mention of this to 
Shuusaku and the others.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:20.480
Why must you alone bear 
such a responsibility?

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:25.540
Entei, whose heart was 
crushed long ago by Migiwa,

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:29.030
and so took my body itself as its new heart,

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:33.550
is the only Buranki on 
Earth capable of moving.

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:38.500
There is a duty I can only fulfill

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.220
because I possess this cursed body.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:43.840
Damn you, Migiwa...

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.280
I will strike with Entei.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:50.640
Souya...

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.870
Don't inconvenience me.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:06.950
I've got a reason I have 
to fight, too, you know.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:11.160
It looks to me like you've got an 
ulterior motive yourself, Matobai-san.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:13.830
I don't know, do I?

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:17.180
In any case, I don't have a lot of time!

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:22.460
The way things are going, the Buranki 
nest will fall on the capital of Russia.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.180
This thing's ten kilometers long.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:28.340
Countless people are likely 
to die in an instant.

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:31.510
It'll end the whole world.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.060
Is that what you want?!

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.590
Answer me, Souya!

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:45.400
Damn you!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.460
Th-Thank you...

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:05.560
I think it's wrong.

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:09.240
Dropping this island on the motherland...

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.400
Where is the heart, you gutter rat?!

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:16.000
Do you have a death wish?!

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.130
Do not anger me any further!

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:21.540
Elder Brother, please calm down.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:30.890
Elder Brother, won't you 
please reconsider this?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.610
However great you may be,

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:38.870
taking innocent lives purely 
for sport is unforgivable.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:42.720
What? Lyudmila, are you 
criticizing our elder brother?!

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.890
What's this about, Lyu?

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:47.380
Since when are you such a philanthropist?

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:54.390
I understand, my gentle Lyu.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.120
Elder Brother—

00:15:56.120 --> 00:16:00.640
Forgive me, but I haven't the time 
to deal with your budding ego.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.810
I've placed a membrane
of Rinzu over your respiratory tract.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.140
Finding it difficult to breathe, aren't you?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.050
You're my precious right hand—
I mean, sister.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.940
I won't kill you.
Just stay like that for a bit.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:20.530
What is that look in your eyes?

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:25.920
You—

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:32.100
She'll be okay now.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.430
Forgive me. I thank you.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:35.640
This island...

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:41.250
It's saying it wants to protect 
the things living on it.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.580
What nonsense are you spouting?!

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.010
Elder Brother, let us withdraw.

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.330
Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:51.060
There are only two of them! 
It's five against two!

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:52.740
You monstrous rock girl!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.280
You mice! Get rid of that heart user!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.490
The more hearts I have, the better!

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.500
What is the meaning of this?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.160
Are you all mad?!

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:12.070
Elder Brother, now it's two against five.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:14.240
Please reconsider.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:18.510
I... We are capable of thinking, too.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.180
Even us limbs.

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:24.730
Don't you dare criticize me!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:30.560
A heart and limbs aren't 
like a king and servants.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.400
If you don't even understand that,

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.030
you don't deserve to possess a heart!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.340
Elder Brother!

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:38.030
You won't get away with that, you—

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.450
Namu...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.670
Heart user of Yaponiya,

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:48.130
please forgive our many 
breaches of propriety.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.960
Because of us, the island...

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:54.470
It's okay. This island is where I was born.

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.400
I'm going to keep it safe.

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:58.660
Okay.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.150
And now, it's over!

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:31.670
It's no use resisting!

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.400
Sorry, Souya.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:01.300
I've won this one.

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:16.460
Wh-What just happened?

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:25.770
Souya, congratulate me.

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:28.760
My kid was just born back on Earth.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.010
Huh?!

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:32.720
Well, congratulations!

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:36.980
Wait! What kind of trap are you 
trying to set for me now?!

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.990
It's nothing like that.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:45.240
I don't have even a drop of Rinzu left.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.930
Huh? Are you really...

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.620
Before...

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:54.550
Before losing all my 
powers as a Bubuki user,

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:57.340
I wanted to destroy Raijoudou.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.970
If I could make her a normal girl,

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.640
she'd be happy.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.510
I've always believed that.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:12.920
But I was too hasty to make that judgment.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.790
With those kids, as a team of five,

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.980
is where she seems to be happiest.

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:23.230
Sorry, Souya. I'm out of the game.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:27.770
Tell me about the principle you believed in.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:37.740
I... I just didn't want to let 
Reoko-sama get in Entei anymore.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:42.230
Everything was forced onto her shoulders,

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:44.100
and she always suffered alone.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:48.170
I couldn't stand it. It was too cruel.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:53.320
You're just like you were as a kid, Little Sou.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:58.020
So nice... and honest...

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:13.190
What are Guy and those Demokratia 
guys thinking, anyway?

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:18.070
Opening the lid to Hell's furnace and 
dropping the whole thing onto Earth?

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.330
They can't be in their right minds.

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:24.680
At this rate, Treasure Island will fall.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:25.910
What?!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:27.050
Where's Migiwa-san?

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:30.490
She said she'd do everything 
she could until the very end.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:31.720
She stayed below.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:32.760
Below?

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:33.600
Yeah.

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:54.260
Migiwa...

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:58.490
You once incinerated my hands and feet.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.740
Now it's your turn to be burned alive!

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:04.210
Mom!

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:07.240
Mom!
